  "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=1$ and $y=1$ into the function definition and then simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =(3y-x)^{3}+(2x-y)^{2} \\\\ f(1,1) & =(3(1)-1)^{3}+(2(1)-1)^{2} \\\\  & ={2}^{3}+{1}^{2} \\\\  & =8+1 \\\\  & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
